    "commentsEn": "<ul>\r\n\t<li>The first phase of the plant started operations on October 1, 2017.</li>\r\n\t<li>Construction works on Phases 2 and 3 are set to be completed by March 2019 and June 2020, respectively.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n",
